{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "8be5a5a4273322d70139bcbcd06657a2941ae81e0f0450846d9da0c30295eb9a", "ja": "空をあおげば", "zh": "仰望天空", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ef9bd1a2147dd259add1d1d057c92375ec448ec8a1229baec59c1b12c5b40cb", "ja": "病院でのクリスマス会は大成功！　子供達の\r\n言葉に励まされたメンバーは、もらった元気\r\nを北東エリアのみんなにお裾分けしようと\r\n話す。そして、本格的な冬を告げるように、\r\n空から雪が降ってくるのだった。", "zh": "医院的圣诞会大获成功！受到孩子们话语鼓励的成员们，决定把收获的活力也分享给东北地区的大家。随后，仿佛宣告着真正冬季的到来，天空中飘起了雪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "923cfd703a3511a7bd0b8cf46700d490e288d35659fa072035821433191f90b2", "ja": "（病院のクリスマス会でのミニコンサートは大成功！\n患者さん達も喜んでくれて、何よりだったな……）", "zh": "（医院的圣诞会上的迷你演唱会大获成功！患者们也都很开心，这就再好不过了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "7ed7bb45a59b02163d7757ad2b3fe8ebd52deb39bc5da2870f31afcdb57683f9", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしたノ？\nなんだかうれしそうだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么了？\n感觉你挺开心的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dbc8f10f20503fa130465e5d7eb532ced2d2a4d45a6d3f8cfe53fd5e0851819b", "ja": "ああ、いや。……今日のクリスマス会を\n思い出してたんだ。みんな、楽しそうだったなって。", "zh": "啊，没什么。……我刚才想起了今天的圣诞聚会。\n大家看起来都很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "de0b0b201000abdcd3447dbe5e4ad46d6fdf9d59118e33cb969d622c3d4bd8ed", "ja": "はい。ピアノの伴奏、とても緊張しましたが、\n患者さんたちの笑顔のおかげで、乗り切れました。", "zh": "是的。虽然给大家伴奏时非常紧张，但多亏了患者们的笑容，才能坚持下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "dde73dcc34ffb58327a390f793a8eabbee0df986abb48bdb6c8d6f42eec89595", "ja": "瑞希の伴奏、とても歌いやすかったですわ。\nちゃんとみんなを見て、合わせてくれたんですのね。", "zh": "有瑞希伴奏，唱起来轻松多了。\n你一直认真观察大家，配合得很到位呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "de64c40433f8b5b89c8dff00531796f10886627853aabce025ec3cef3e6215f2", "ja": "うん、助かったよ。\nすっごく楽しくて、あっという間だったなー。", "zh": "嗯，帮大忙了。\n特别开心，一转眼就结束了呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "25f92748da77f8181c126c0967ab1ef5bdaa5ea9ea03d3f63d2aeee7fd067e64", "ja": "合唱団のみんなも、病院の人たちも、\nみーんな笑顔だったもんネ！", "zh": "合唱团的大家也是，医院里的人们也是，\n大家全～都在笑呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6c9eafc7b3a90f407e875d9b9fe3af3b49ac784b0058c839de32bdd83f12f164", "ja": "そうだな。みんなは、患者さん達から\nお礼の手紙をもらったんだろ？", "zh": "是啊。大家都收到了患者们的感谢信吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "5bef8e6ae27352956aab5bb0a39627013c560014d7049e8d3bb3b89af44b844c", "ja": "はい。『ツアー絶対成功しますように！』\n『応援してます！』って書いてありました！", "zh": "是的。上面写着“祝愿巡演一定成功！”“我会为你们加油！” мәлум", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "f1a9492efe0790b3f1a489e613abd697ae57b364098317706c3e7d11ec5072a6", "ja": "わたくしたちの、似顔絵が描いてあるお手紙も\nありましたわよ。ふふっ、みんなかわいいですわね。", "zh": "还有信上画了我们的画像呢。\n呵呵，大家都好可爱呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "970e1e29b49b42601273f63fdd554a1851fdc60de2fe81bd3ad82e06a86fa521", "ja": "あ、入院してる合唱団の子も、\nもうすぐ退院できるって言ってました！", "zh": "啊，住院的合唱团孩子也说，\n自己很快就能出院了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d8d4c1e64dc20a4f576aa7bff065b6ba6781295e71f03524e3086f74c9e088d8", "ja": "あの子、本当にうれしそうだったな。\n真に憧れてるって言ってたから……。", "zh": "那孩子看起来真的很开心啊。\n因为她说很憧憬真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fed338d7c8083eaef311b0a709b4700b15a9ebec34ab1975fb71185dffe621b1", "ja": "もしかすると、将来は本当に、\n真みたいなアイドルになるかもしれないな。", "zh": "说不定将来真的会成为\n像真一样的偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "ae39cb646dcfbecb18a96073ff99bdc3b8c49ecaebe718067ba66fa8fb8dc494", "ja": "ぼ、ボクみたいな！？\nでも、本当にそうだったらうれしいな……へへっ♪", "zh": "像、像我这样的！？\n不过，如果真的能那样的话，我会很开心……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "281c7c4ad3e53dde1df928ac615a84e958b61c6e5c44776adb1063df136f4f0e", "ja": "なんだか、患者さんたちを励ましに来たのに、\n逆に、ボクたちが励まされちゃいましたね。", "zh": "总觉得我们本来是来给患者们打气的，结果反倒被患者们鼓励了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "8a1f45d263b67d10eadd9889761c9e7f6a6e8b4cf591ac3fe7a989ecaccadebf", "ja": "ふふっ、本当ですわね。", "zh": "呵呵，确实如此呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "b1586806294d4e331516a20685dfc91bb0b27d4a54fee9a12c4ed26b356aca7e", "ja": "ダイジョーブ！　たくさん元気をもらったから、\n北東エリアのみんなに、おすそわけすればいいんだヨ♪", "zh": "没问题！因为我得到了满满的活力，只要把它分给东北地区的大家就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "0aabf0bd0546805bab6e703870815c3b1d37c6ca27fbd3662888a97f10bd5c6e", "ja": "さすがです、島原さん。\n……笑顔のお裾分け、がんばるぞ。", "zh": "不愧是岛原同学。  \n……我要努力把笑容分享给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2350d35ac7ef5af1e4c5dc535aab26eb526db573712b73c9cb15ce7791e6ac0a", "ja": "それにしても、ずいぶん冷えてきたな……。\nみんな、風邪を引かないように早く帰ろう。", "zh": "话说回来，天气也冷起来了……  \n大家早点回去，别感冒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "856c219717fa7292b0a74b638a9396145181768e90dfc715e00f59fd93609560", "ja": "そうですね！", "zh": "没错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "2207a61b511dce5e66f39d06563cc20ebb65f32f01ed5c65e78bae4abca8f3be", "ja": "……あっ！　みんな、見て！", "zh": "……啊！大家快看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "5f279f107bf45e1b31e1fd3f7fa169c7ab0233bef6d62060f4c302883d5631a6", "ja": "まぁ……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e43a65216a550bded72aa63317ae5eaa258403b41199dbe73049487927cf8f5", "ja": "雪だ……！", "zh": "下雪了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee659e890ad7c5218c8d0cd25471041490ed932569b25870a4a4412d400ba369", "ja": "なんと……この様子なら、東京でも\n雪合戦ができるかもしれませんね。", "zh": "没想到……照这个样子，说不定在东京也能打雪仗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "2253ccf66a143c83ac202770b8fc7eb042baf64ee167b263bfcb4eb4da3f7855", "ja": "わーい、雪合戦！\nワタシ、誰にも負けないヨ！", "zh": "哇—，打雪仗！\n我可不会输给任何人哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "9694be532c382672b52b87594fa8c1317d436018d19f90e1f582f1f245d22689", "ja": "お、ボクだって負けないぞ？\n……はっくしゅん！！", "zh": "哦，我也不会输的哦？\n……哈啾！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "96645611a704e1f27798ab7f075b6430a460e26f2c701d34c976fe0d4bc938d2", "ja": "おっと。その前に、本当に風邪を引かないように……\nみんな、走って帰ろう！", "zh": "等等。在那之前，大家可千万别真的感冒了……\n我们跑着回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "08a64ba917ef7e5dd5185892a50d41988b5582f54be3a80ff8a1a52a57432576", "ja": "（本格的に寒くなってきた。\n北東エリアの次の公演まで、もうすぐだ！）", "zh": "（天气已经彻底冷起来了。\n离东北地区的下一场公演也快到了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
